 "remarks": "Jewel box of a home set on almost 2 acres surrounded by nature. Nothing to do but move into this picture-perfect home and enjoy! From the 15'x12' screened-in porch to the new gravel fire pit to the 179-acre state-protected park (Woodcock Nature Center) in your backyard, you will be able to enjoy nature at its finest. Inside the home, there are 8 rooms with hardwood floors, new doors on the bedrooms and closets, and new Marvin windows throughout. The beautifully remodeled kitchen offers a farm sink and a Sub-Zero refrigerator. Also, there is new cabinetry, quartz countertops, a breakfast bar, and a Viking stove. Bathrooms have been updated. Come check out this home yourself-you'll be glad you did. Yes, there is room for a pool. PS The septic is 6 years old. Bill Dexter put it in.",
